\f0\fs24 \cf0 Weekly Math Challenge pilot program is an optional free math enrichment program for Ponderosa students (grade 4 and grade 1). It consists of series of challenging and interesting grade-appropriate problems that encourage critical thinking. All the problems are similar in style to those found in math contests such as Math Kangaroo and Noetic Math. The Weekly Math Challenge will run for 12 weeks (with one extra week of bonus. Each week will have 5 or 6 problems across five cognitive skills (Logical Reasoning, Geometry and Spatial Sense, Combinatorics, Number and Operations and Word Problems). \
